OL,5,G1030 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe final visit is to the Crescent
OL,7,     FVictoria hotel in Margate, Kent,
OL,8,     Fwhere Farid and John hope to
OL,9,     Fdazzle their guests with a stay
OL,10,     Ffit for a queen. Can they get the
OL,11,     Fbreakfast right?
